# rustc-1.96.0.answers — byte-seal pins for packages/rustc-1.96.0, in `sha256sum` format.
# build.sh P6 runs `sha256sum -c` on this file from ${OUTPUT_DIR} when it contains a `<64 hex>  <path>`
# line; with none present the seal is skipped.  To arm: add `{ file = "rustc-1.96.0.answers" } | Local`
# to build.ncl's build_deps and paste the two sums below, uncommented.
# Pin only bin/rustc and bin/cargo; lib/rustlib/** is covered transitively by them.
#
# UNPINNED
# usr/lib/rustc-1.96.0/bin/rustc
# usr/lib/rustc-1.96.0/bin/cargo
